# Build context for `build: ./web` (docker-compose.example.yml).
#
# web/Dockerfile does `COPY . .` before `npm run build`. A host `node_modules/`
# copied in would shadow the tree `npm ci` just installed — different platform,
# different resolution — which is exactly the reproducibility `npm ci` is there
# to buy. Everything else here is output or test material the bundle never
# references.
#
# Pinned by server/tests/test_dockerfile_contract.py (issue #234).

# Dependency tree and build output — the image makes its own
node_modules/
dist/
build/

# Tests and coverage
coverage/
src/**/*.test.js
src/**/*.test.jsx
src/setupTests.js

# Secrets and local config
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Documentation and repo metadata
*.md
.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore
